            <div xml:id="ch6">

                <pb facs="0703" n="641" sameAs="frus:frus1945v01/pg641"/>

                <head>Chapter V: May 8–May 31, 1945</head>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>Beginning of open Conference discussion of Dumbarton Oaks Proposals and
                        changes recommended by Sponsoring Powers and other participating
                        Governments; exploratory discussions in meetings of United States delegation
                        to establish position to be taken by U.S. delegates on all matters in
                        connection with Conference; consultative meetings with other Sponsoring
                        Governments and France to reach unanimous agreement on final position to be
                        taken in meetings of the twelve technical committees by any one of the Five
                        Powers with respect to proposed amendments; informal consultative meetings
                        of United States delegates with Latin American representatives on regional
                        arrangements; Five-Power agreement reached with regard to proposals on
                        regionalism and trusteeship.</p>
                </quote>




















































